  "description": "Stimulsoft Reports.AVALONIA is a product designed for working with reports in applications developed using Avalonia technology on the .NET Core, .NET 6, .NET 7, and .NET 8 platforms. The reporting components fully support all the features of the modern Avalonia UI framework, functioning across various operating systems such as Windows, macOS, and Linux. Additionally, these components incorporate all user requirements for creating professional reports.",
